## Visual Studio & C# .NET Ignore Rules
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build outputs
bin/
obj/
*.pdb

## Temporary and local cache files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.cache

## NuGet Package Archives (keep DLLs for instant build, ignore cache archives)
packages/**/*.nupkg

## Local scratch files
scratch/
*.ps1
token.txt
